<p><strong>Meia-Noite e Uns</strong> was a pop-literature television program broadcast by RedeTV! and hosted by Soninha Francine. Marcelo Nicchio served as <strong>Artistic Director</strong> and <strong>Executive Producer</strong> alongside <strong>Cristiano Gonçalves</strong>, through <strong>Dreamsnetwork.tv</strong>.</p><p>Nicchio created the artistic and visual concept and the narrative structure. Paulão de Carvalho took part in the writing and co-presented the program at Nicchio's invitation; the theme music was written and produced with Fábio “Badi” Crepaldi.</p><figure class="thread-media thread-media--linked"><a aria-label="Open the Meia-Noite e Uns visual collage at full size" href="/assets/archive/audiovisual/meia-noite-e-uns/meianoiteeuns-thread.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><img alt="Collage of photographs and illustrations from the television program Meia-Noite e Uns, broadcast by RedeTV! in 2006." decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/archive/audiovisual/meia-noite-e-uns/meianoiteeuns-thread.jpg" width="932" height="919"/></a><figcaption><strong>Meia-Noite e Uns · 2006.</strong><span class="thread-media-note">Visual collage combining photographs and illustrations from the program.</span><a class="thread-media-open" href="/assets/archive/audiovisual/meia-noite-e-uns/meianoiteeuns-thread.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open full-size image ↗</a></figcaption></figure><p>The intended title was originally <strong>Meia-Noite e Um</strong> (“12:01 a.m.”), linked to a blog of the same name and the idea of starting one minute after midnight. Because the exact minute could not be guaranteed in the schedule, the title became <strong>Meia-Noite e Uns</strong>.</p><div aria-label="Preserved Meia-Noite e Uns videos" class="record-media-block"><div class="record-media-block__head"><span>Preserved videos</span><strong>Watch the program</strong></div><div class="record-media-block__links"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kLQAlzgwmy0" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Block 1 ↗</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f-JZfMoHh1I" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Block 2 ↗</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6s6843Mq5MA" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Block 3 ↗</a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tIGlLDpzQ7E" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Title sequence &amp; credits ↗</a></div></div><!-- gallery:meia-noite-e-uns:start -->
